    "scenesThatPass": [
      "LOW-RANKING POLICE OFFICER: Miss Marina Vidal?\nMARINA: Yes, what is it?",
      "LOW-RANKING POLICE OFFICER: Sargent\nCHIEF POLICE OFFICER: Thank you\nLOW-RANKING POLICE OFFICER: Excuse me\nMARINA: You didn’t have to treat me like a criminal.",
      "MARINA: Thanks.\nCHIEF POLICE OFFICER: Your phone number, please.\nMARINA: Yes... 98149575.",
      "MARINA: Yes, right away.\nALESSANDRA: You didn’t want to come, and I was just calling you to ask if you could take the night shift. Crap.\nMARINA: I didn’t get to check my phone, Alessandra. The celebration was pretty intense.\nALESSANDRA: But you came. I appreciate that. Do you need anything?",
      "MARINA: Right away.\nALESSANDRA: Marina, someone’s looking for you outside.\nMARINA: Who?\nALESSANDRA: I Don’t know."
    ]
